# Line endings are pinned here rather than left to each machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with autocrlf=true checks the whole tree out as
# CRLF, and any tool that rewrites a file with LF shows up as a modification
# whose `git diff` is empty — the Tauri CLI does exactly that to
# src-tauri/Cargo.toml during `tauri dev`. Storing and checking out LF
# everywhere makes the working tree identical on Windows and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never inspected for text, never converted. These are the only
# binary extensions the tree actually carries (icons and bundle artwork).
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
